{
  "id": "motor-cascade",
  "order": 16,
  "level": 4,
  "plant": null,
  "title": {
    "es": "Arranque en cascada de tres motores",
    "en": "Cascade start of three motors"
  },
  "statement": {
    "es": [
      "Una línea tiene tres motores. Al pulsar MARCHA (I0.0) arranca MOTOR_1 (Q0.0); 2 segundos después arranca MOTOR_2 (Q0.1) y 2 segundos después de ese, MOTOR_3 (Q0.2). Así se evita el pico de corriente de arrancar todos juntos.",
      "PARO (I0.1, pulsador NC) detiene los tres motores al instante."
    ],
    "en": [
      "A line has three motors. Pressing START (I0.0) starts MOTOR_1 (Q0.0); 2 seconds later MOTOR_2 (Q0.1) starts, and 2 seconds after that, MOTOR_3 (Q0.2). This avoids the current peak of starting them all at once.",
      "STOP (I0.1, NC push button) stops all three motors immediately."
    ]
  },
  "io": [
    {
      "address": "I0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "MARCHA",
        "en": "START"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pulsador de marcha (NA)",
        "en": "Start push button (NO)"
      },
      "mode": "button-no"
    },
    {
      "address": "I0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "PARO",
        "en": "STOP"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pulsador de paro (NC: 1 en reposo)",
        "en": "Stop push button (NC: 1 at rest)"
      },
      "mode": "button-nc"
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "MOTOR_1",
        "en": "MOTOR_1"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Contactor del motor 1",
        "en": "Motor 1 contactor"
      }
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "MOTOR_2",
        "en": "MOTOR_2"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Contactor del motor 2",
        "en": "Motor 2 contactor"
      }
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.2",
      "name": {
        "es": "MOTOR_3",
        "en": "MOTOR_3"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Contactor del motor 3",
        "en": "Motor 3 contactor"
      }
    }
  ],
  "allowed": ["NO", "NC", "coil", "set", "reset", "TON", "TOF", "TP"],
  "hints": {
    "es": [
      "Empieza por la autorretención de MOTOR_1 con MARCHA y PARO.",
      "Un TON con la entrada en MOTOR_1 retrasa el arranque del segundo motor. Otro TON con la entrada en MOTOR_2 retrasa el tercero.",
      "Peldaño 1: (MARCHA O MOTOR_1), PARO → MOTOR_1. Peldaño 2: MOTOR_1 → TON T0 (T#2s) → MOTOR_2. Peldaño 3: MOTOR_2 → TON T1 (T#2s) → MOTOR_3."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Start with the seal-in of MOTOR_1 with START and STOP.",
      "A TON with its input on MOTOR_1 delays the start of the second motor. Another TON with its input on MOTOR_2 delays the third.",
      "Rung 1: (START OR MOTOR_1), STOP → MOTOR_1. Rung 2: MOTOR_1 → TON T0 (T#2s) → MOTOR_2. Rung 3: MOTOR_2 → TON T1 (T#2s) → MOTOR_3."
    ]
  },
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "Arrancan uno tras otro cada 2 segundos",
        "en": "They start one after another every 2 seconds"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 300,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 1000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false,
            "Q0.2": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1900,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 2400,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": true,
            "Q0.2": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 3900,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.2": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 4400,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": true,
            "Q0.2": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "PARO detiene todo, también a mitad del arranque",
        "en": "STOP stops everything, also halfway through the start"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 300,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 3000,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 3200,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 2600,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 3300,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": false,
            "Q0.2": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 6000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": false,
            "Q0.2": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
